{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_gossip", "label": "Gossip-Replikation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Periodisches Full-State-Gossip an einen zufaelligen Peer; Writes propagieren eventually (typisch 1-2 Runden). Lokale Writes sind sofort, Gossip ist nur fuer die Propagation."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_gossipinterval", "label": "gossipInterval", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default 1 s als Balance zwischen Propagationsgeschwindigkeit und Bandbreite; auch ueber actor-ts.distributed-data.gossip-interval setzbar, Builder gewinnt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_max_gossip_bytes", "label": "max-gossip-bytes", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default 1 MiB, immer auf remote.max-frame-bytes heruntergeschnitten. Ohne Budget erzeugte ein grosser Store ein Frame jenseits des Wire-Caps, das der Empfaenger schon am 4-Byte-Laengenpraefix ablehnt und dabei die Verbindung verwirft - ueber die auch Heartbeats, Membership-Gossip und jedes tell laufen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_remote_max_frame_bytes", "label": "remote.max-frame-bytes", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_crdt_merge", "label": "Per-Key-CRDT-Merge", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Idempotent und kommutativ - deshalb ist das Zuschneiden eines Frames sicher: ein fehlender Key heisst keine Information, nicht geloescht; ein Key spaeter oder doppelt aendert nur wann, nicht wohin der Cluster konvergiert."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_subscribe", "label": "dd.subscribe", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Feuert synchron nach jedem Merge, der den lokalen Wert aendert (Deep-Equal ueber toJSON); Subscriptions sind lokal, idempotente Updates feuern nicht."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_tombstones", "label": "CRDT-Tombstones", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Werden nie garbage-collected, damit veraltetes Gossip einen entfernten Key nicht wiederauferstehen laesst; ueber einen langlebigen Store mit Churn ist die Akkumulation der praktische Kostenpunkt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_random_peer_selection", "label": "Zufaellige Peer-Auswahl pro Runde", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Round-Robin waere vorhersagbarer, erzeugt aber synchronisierte Wellen; ein zufaelliger Peer pro Tick verteilt die Last und konvergiert typisch in O(log N) Runden - Wahrscheinlichkeit (1 - 1/N)^K, dass ein Peer ein Update nach K Runden nicht hat."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_anti_entropy", "label": "Anti-Entropy-Gossip-Topologie", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All-to-all ueber die Zeit, O(N) pro Node pro Runde; ab 50+ Nodes relevant, andere Topologien sind aktuell nicht konfigurierbar."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_gossip_skipped_keys_total", "label": "distributed_data_gossip_skipped_keys_total", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein einzelner Key, dessen Kodierung das Budget ueberschreitet, ist unteilbar - er wird uebersprungen, ratenbegrenzt gewarnt und gezaehlt: dieser Key konvergiert nicht."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_eventual_convergence", "label": "Eventual Convergence", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gossip ueberbrueckt keine Partitionen - CRDTs garantieren eventual convergence, nicht Echtzeit-Zustellung; Lesepfade sollten mit veralteten Daten funktionieren."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_quorum_reads_writes", "label": "Quorum Reads/Writes (getAsync consistency majority)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_member_removed_noop", "label": "MemberRemoved ist ein No-op fuer DistributedData", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Es gibt keinen Zustand pro Peer - kein Version Vector, keine Empfangs-Historie; jeder Tick waehlt aus den aktuellen Up-Members, ein ausgeschiedener Node ist damit einfach kein Ziel mehr."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_gossip", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_gossipinterval", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_gossip", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_max_gossip_bytes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_max_gossip_bytes", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_remote_max_frame_bytes", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_crdt_merge", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_max_gossip_bytes", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_gossip", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_crdt_merge", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_subscribe", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_crdt_merge", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_tombstones", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_crdt_merge", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_random_peer_selection", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_gossip", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_anti_entropy", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_gossip", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_max_gossip_bytes", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_gossip_skipped_keys_total", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_gossip", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_eventual_convergence", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_eventual_convergence", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_quorum_reads_writes", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_member_removed_noop", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_random_peer_selection", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_subscribe", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_eventstream", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_max_gossip_bytes", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_security_input_caps", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.65, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/replication.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}], "hyperedges": []}